===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|enclave|lang=fr}}, from {{etyl|frm|en}} {{term|enclave||enclave|lang=frm}}, deverbal of {{etyl|frm|en}} {{term|enclaver||to inclose|lang=frm}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|enclaver||to inclose, lock in|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|VL.|en}} *{{term||inclāvāre|to lock in|lang=la}}, from {{term|in|lang=la}} + {{term|clavis||key|lang=la}} or {{term|clavus||nail, bolt|lang=la}}. Compare {{l|en|inlock}}.

